duce causal ordering errors under skewed clocks.\n\n## Approach\n\nRemove the production disable branch, its environment registration, documentation, and tests. Retain legacy event reads and deterministic test-time clock injection, which are distinct compatibility and testability contracts.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/_store/hlc.py`\n- HLC environment/config registry and maintained documentation\n- `tests/unit/test_hlc.py`\n\nCascade flag: true. Recensus environment parsing, dynamic reads, docs, fixtures, and monkeypatch consumers.\n\n## Testing\n\nCover legacy event reduction/read compatibility and deterministic injected-clock ordering after the disable branch is gone.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `REBAR_HLC=0` no longer disables HLC or appears in the live environment/config registry.\n- [ ] Maintained documentation and tests for the expired rollback branch are removed.\n- [ ] Legacy events remain readable and deterministic test-time clock injection remains available.\n- [ ] HLC ordering tests, focused store tests, lint, and typecheck pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_store/hlc.py","reason":"remove expired disable branch while retaining clock injection and reads"},{"path":"src/rebar/_deprecations.py","reason":"remove any live HLC rollback environment registration"},{"path":"docs/remediation-implementation-plan.md","reason":"remove completed rollback-switch guidance"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_hlc.py","reason":"retain legacy-read and injected-clock coverage while removing disable tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","store","deprecation","rp27"],"ticket_id":"fdd1-12fa-ce83-45d1","ticket_type":"story","title":"Re